 tf("Painted cycle lanes are as effective as physically separated ones.", "False", "Malowane linie 'do little to reassure nervous riders'."),
 tf("Some studies show that cyclists and pedestrians spend more at local shops over a month.", "True", "Akapit 3."),
 mc("Why does the writer mention politicians losing elections?", ["To show how strong opposition can be.", "To argue that cycling schemes are a mistake.", "To criticise voters for being short-sighted.", "To explain why schemes are temporary."], "To show how strong opposition can be.", "Kontekst: 'Opposition, however, can be fierce.'", {"To argue that cycling schemes are a mistake.": "Autor nie ocenia ich negatywnie.", "To criticise voters for being short-sighted.": "Brak krytyki wyborców.", "To explain why schemes are temporary.": "Tymczasowość wynika z innej strategii."}),
 mc("Temporary trials were useful because they", ["let people try the changes before deciding.", "were cheaper to remove than to build.", "satisfied shopkeepers immediately.", "prevented any criticism."], "let people try the changes before deciding.", "'allowed residents to experience the change before passing judgement'.", {"were cheaper to remove than to build.": "Koszt nie jest wspomniany.", "satisfied shopkeepers immediately.": "Brak takiej informacji.", "prevented any criticism.": "Krytyka nadal istniała."}),
